1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,419
Divide by the mass, and the acceleration is minus k over m, times x.

2
00:00:06,419 --> 00:00:09,778
We write k over m as omega squared.

3
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:13,059
So a equals minus omega squared x.

4
00:00:13,059 --> 00:00:17,317
Any motion that obeys this rule is called simple harmonic motion.

5
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:19,231
Learn that sentence exactly.

6
00:00:19,231 --> 00:00:21,822
Every result in this chapter grows from it.

